Europa 64-bit-only patch ported to GCC 13.4.0.
Forces all RISC-V memory accesses to use ld/sd exclusively,
required by the Europa APU which does not support sub-64-bit memory operations.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific - Europa APU hardware requirement]
Signed-off-by: Axelera AI <sw@axelera.ai>

